blurb: The board reviewed the annual State of the Schools presentation, which detailed
  significant demographic shifts, analyzed student academic performance and attendance
  data, and shared student survey results on school climate. The meeting also featured
  a tribute to the district's former DEI director and premiered a video highlighting
  the "You Belong Here" theme.
